> form content/sample factions.toml city_watch
factions.toml › city_watch: The City Watch
Identity
  Name · name = The City Watch
Where it stands
  Alignment › Law · alignment.law = 70.0
  Alignment › Good · alignment.good = 20.0
  # Cares about order far more than kindness.
  Weights › Law · weights.law = 1.0
  Weights › Good · weights.good = 0.25
Membership
  Tolerance · tolerance = 40.0
  Member tolerance · member_tolerance = 50.0
  Standing change on expulsion · expel_standing_change: not set, -20.00
  Standing change on leaving · leave_standing_change: not set, 0.00
  Secret members · secret_members: not set, false (false or true)
Drift
  # The Watch gives a straying officer a hundred ticks to mend their ways.
  Drift › Policy · drift.policy = probation (ignore, flag, demote, expel or probation)
  Drift › Grace (ticks) · drift.grace_ticks = 100
  Drift › Then · drift.then = expel (demote or expel)
Ranks
  Rank "recruit" › Id · ranks[0].id = recruit
  Rank "sergeant" › Id · ranks[1].id = sergeant
  Rank "sergeant" › Requirements › Standing · ranks[1].requires.standing = 30.0
  Rank "captain" › Id · ranks[2].id = captain
  Rank "captain" › Requirements › Standing · ranks[2].requires.standing = 70.0
  # Captains are held to a stricter standard than the faction's member tolerance.
  Rank "captain" › Tolerance · ranks[2].tolerance = 25.0
  + Rank
Its own rules
  + Defectors
  + Deserters
  + Exposed
